cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "LUNA: A Differentiable Astrophysical Hydrodynamics Code"
abstract: >-
  A differentiable JAX-based hydrodynamics code for stratified flows,
  ISM physics, and galactic winds, with multi-GPU shard_map parallelism,
  FMG-Poisson self-gravity, a sharded particle-mesh, and reverse-mode
  autodiff through the full solver.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Steinwandel
    given-names: Ulrich Philipp
version: 0.1.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ulli1991/LUNA"
url: "https://github.com/Ulli1991/LUNA"
keywords:
  - hydrodynamics
  - JAX
  - GPU
  - astrophysics
  - ISM
  - differentiable programming
